- corpus/bphs/sanskritdocuments.json: the full sanskritdocuments.org transcription of
  the Bṛhat-Parāśara-Horāśāstra (97 chapters, 3,932 verses; pages par0110 … par9197,
  fetched 2026-09-21), redistributed under the terms as stated by the source; see
  corpus/bphs/README.md. editions/parashara-rahasya-full-edition.html prints 268 verses
  of 7 chapters from it (chapters 16, 18, 20, 22, 23, 25 and 35; the source of every
  verse is recorded in corpus/bphs/canon.json).
- Sanskrit Wikisource (sa.wikisource.org): corpus/bphs/wikisource.json, the Wikisource
  बृहत्पाराशरहोराशास्त्रम् (wikitext fetched 2026-08-11; 97 chapters, 3,943 verses), and
  the 3,675 verses of editions/parashara-rahasya-full-edition.html taken from it
  (corpus/bphs/canon.json); also the mūla text of
  editions/surya-siddhanta-full-edition.html and editions/panini-rahasya-full-edition.html,
